Changes from upstream:
  rust/highlights.scm  The all-caps constant pattern's regex ended in a stray
                       quote and never matched. It is fixed and moved after the
                       constructor pattern, since the later pattern wins.
  diff/highlights.scm  Additions and deletions capture @diff.plus and
                       @diff.minus instead of @string and @keyword.
  toml/highlights.scm  A pair's bare key captures @property; upstream captured
                       the whole pair, so the key itself stayed @type.

Zed's own queries (crates/grammars in zed-industries/zed) are GPL-3.0 and are
not used here.

